====================================
  BrainFuck Comment Demonstration
====================================

This entire text is treated as a comment!
Any character that is NOT one of the 8 BF commands is ignored

The eight commands are plus minus left right output input and brackets

Everything else is a comment

Here is a simple program to print the letter H (ASCII code 72):

Ten times seven equals seventy
++++++++++[>+++++++<-]

Now cell 1 has 70; add 2 more to get 72 and print it
>++.

Done! The program is complete
